### 1. **Pre-existing Test Failure Blocking npm test** (sw-code-review-test.sh:40)
```bash
sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g" "$TEST_TEMP_DIR/bin/git"
```
This uses **BSD sed syntax** (`sed -i ''`), which fails on Linux GNU sed. This is NOT caused by the agent's work—it existed before the loop—but it blocks `npm test` from completing. The error appears as:
```
